%% @alt A Claude Code session reads from three sources. CLAUDE.md files, written by you, load at launch from the managed, user, project and local scopes. Auto memory, a MEMORY.md index with topic files that Claude Code writes as it works, also loads at launch. Context passed on the command line lasts for that session only.
